      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/13/six-flags-rollercoaster-death",
      "description": "<p>Hassan Jihad Ibn Kariem was a father of 10-year-old daughter, and overcame two bouts of cancer, his family says</p><p>Police on Tuesday identified the victim of the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/video/2026/oct/13/aerial-footage-shows-people-rescued-from-rollercoaster-after-fatal-incident-at-six-flags-video\">fatal accident at Six Flags Over Georgia </a>as 42-year-old Hassan Jihad Ibn Kariem of Atlanta.</p><p>Kariem fell to his death after being ejected from his seat and several others were injured in an incident involving a rollercoaster at the theme park.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/13/six-flags-rollercoaster-death\">Continue reading...</a>",
